[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3 uid="uid://b2apiaquobtkx"]

; [ui-project-longshot] Retargeted to the concept board.
;
; Every modal in the game (shop, run summary, compare flyout) draws its chrome
; from here rather than from OrnateFrame, so this file is the one place that
; brings them onto the board's language - and the reason the modals could be
; fixed without touching any of their scenes. The console's own panels are
; OrnateFrame-drawn and deliberately do NOT read these styles; see
; scripts/console/ornate_frame.gd.
;
; The buttons were a blue-and-gold set left from the old fair-weather palette,
; which put a saturated cornflower rectangle in the middle of every shop row.
; They are dark carved green with gold trim now - the same two materials the
; console is made of, so a shop panel reads as the same object as the cabinet
; behind it.

[ext_resource type="FontVariation" path="res://assets/display_font.tres" id="1_display"]
[ext_resource type="FontVariation" path="res://assets/body_font.tres" id="2_body"]

