; [ui-project-longshot] Secondary action. The shop's Compare button sits beside
; Buy on every card and beside Equip/Sell on every row, and on the full Button
; style it carried exactly as much weight as the action it sits next to - three
; identical gold-trimmed plates per row, with nothing saying which one is the
; point of the row. Same two materials, one step back: the trim drops to the
; dark gold the unselected tab uses and the fill sits at the panel's own colour,
; so it reads as a control rather than as an offer.
