; The shop's Buy/Sell tabs. Godot's defaults are a white-on-black chip pair
; that survived every previous art pass because nothing else in the game uses
; a TabContainer - against a gold-trimmed stone panel they were the last piece
; of untouched engine chrome on screen. Selected reads as a lit stone tab
; continuous with the panel below it; unselected sits back and dim.
[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="tab_selected"]
